stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Inbox entry" as Inbox {
        [*] --> processing : first event delivery
        processing --> committed : transaction commits\nwith execution ID
    }

    state "Execution" as Execution {
        [*] --> pending
        pending --> completed : decision persisted
        pending --> failed : terminal processing error
        pending --> quarantined : permanent error
    }

    state "Outbox effect" as Outbox {
        [*] --> pending
        pending --> claimed : publisher claims it
        claimed --> delivered : destination succeeds
        claimed --> pending : retry after backoff
        claimed --> quarantined : max attempts reached
    }

    note right of Inbox
        A unique tenant_id + event_id
        permits one committed execution.
    end note

    note right of Outbox
        A claim expires so another
        publisher can recover abandoned work.
    end note
